OL,3,GNEWSAMan quizzed over huge illegal
OL,4,Awaste dumps
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested in connection
OL,7,Fwith the illegal dumping of "thousands
OL,8,Fof tonnes of waste" at sites across
OL,9,Fnorth-east England.
OL,11,FThe 32-year-old from Sunderland is
OL,12,Fbeing questioned in connection with
OL,13,Fdumps at the former Dewhirst Site in
OL,14,FPeterlee and Hart Quarry in Hartlepool.
OL,16,FThe arrest came as part of a wider
OL,17,Finvestigation by Northumbria Police and
OL,18,Fthe Environment Agency (EA) into the
OL,19,Ftwo sites, as well as a third at
OL,20,FCallerton near Newcastle Airport.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
